### [LECTURA] Página 1 (máximo 6 en data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams?page=1&limit=6&search=

### [LECTURA] Página 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams?page=2&limit=6&search=

### [LECTURA] Página 3
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams?page=3&limit=6&search=

### [LECTURA] Búsqueda sin importar mayúsculas (debe encontrar Chiefs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams?page=1&limit=6&search=CHIEFS

### [LECTURA] Buscar uno
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/1

### [LECTURA] Id que no existe (debe dar 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/9999

### [AUTH] 1. Registrar usuario (debe dar 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "clave123" }

### [AUTH] 2. Registrar el MISMO usuario otra vez (debe dar 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "clave123" }

### [AUTH] 3. Login correcto (devuelve access_token y lo guarda)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "clave123" }

###

@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### [AUTH] 4. Login con contraseña incorrecta (debe dar 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "clave-incorrecta" }

### [AUTH] 5. Perfil SIN token (debe dar 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile

### [AUTH] 6. Perfil CON token (debe dar 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [ESCRITURA] Crear SIN token (debe dar 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Team", "city": "Test City", "conference": "AFC", "image": "https://picsum.photos/300/200" }

### [ESCRITURA] Crear CON token (debe dar 201)
# @name createTest
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "name": "Test Team", "city": "Test City", "conference": "AFC", "image": "https://picsum.photos/300/200" }

### [ESCRITURA] Editar SIN token (debe dar 401)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "KC Chiefs" }

### [ESCRITURA] Editar CON token (solo cambia el name)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "name": "KC Chiefs" }

### [ESCRITURA] Eliminar el Test Team que acabas de crear (debe dar 200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{createTest.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}